#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Turns each returned row, form response or cited passage into one comment and resolves its anchor through the review version's page/line map. A citation that resolves to nothing is kept as unplaced, never dropped."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:81
